          "className": "w-[120px] h-[21px]"
        }
      ],
      "additionalDetailsItems": [
        {
          "id": "perfect-for",
          "title": "What makes it magical",
          "contentType": "list",
          "listItems": [
            "Give the delicate skin of your under-eyes a much needed hydration boost",
            "Contain powerful cooling and soothing properties to visibly de-puff even the worst of eye bags",
            "Counteract the visual effects of the sun, poor sleep, harsh makeup removal, and dry, ageing skin"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how-to-use",
          "title": "How To Use",
          "contentType": "list",
          "apidata": true,
          "listItems": [
            "Apply under eyes on makeup-free skin",
            "Wear for 15-20 minutes (or however long feels nice!)",
            "Discard and pat remaining essence into skin. No need to rinse."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "perfect-for",
          "title": "Perfect For",
          "contentType": "list",
          "listItems": [
            "Late nights & early mornings",
            "Soothing puffy, irritated eyes",
            "Combatting the appearance of dark circles",
            "Minimizing visible fine lines & wrinkles"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "key-ingredients",
          "title": "Key Ingredients",
          "contentType": "list",
          "apidata": false,
          "listItems": [
            "Niacinamide is known to support a healthy skin barrier, hydrating skin to make it feel firmer and to prevent premature signs of aging",
            "Hyaluronic Acid deeply hydrates skin to refine the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles",
            "Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract is obtained from the leaves of tea plants and helps to soothe puffiness",
            "Rosemary Leaf Extract helps to bring down puffiness puffiness, lighten the appearance of dark spots, and diminish visible blemishes"
          ]
        }
      ]
